    "methods_description": "Patients underwent paired 3T and 7T MRI, including structural scans and resting-state fMRI. Intracranial EEG (ECoG grids/strips and/or SEEG depth electrodes) was sampled at 500, 512 or 1024 Hz. Ictal epochs were selected from epileptologist notes, and interictal epochs were randomly selected under timing constraints relative to implantation and seizures. Electrodes were localized on post-implant CT and mapped to pre-implant MRI with iEEG-recon.",
